        "section": [
          {
            "text": {
              "status": "generated",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h3>Annotation</h3><table class=\"hl7__eu__lab__report\"><tr><th>Conclusion and Recommendations based on this report and previous findings known to us</th></tr><tr><td>The patient shows a decreased CD3+CD4+ (T4 helper) cell count, which is below the normal reference range. This finding may indicate immunosuppression or an underlying immune deficiency. Clinical correlation and further investigation are recommended to determine the cause and assess the need for additional immunological evaluation.</td></tr></table></div>"
